      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Transcribing %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "読みが違う判定は音響情報を使っていないため、確度が落ちます。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Judging differing readings ignores the acoustics, so confidence drops."
